    <section class="hero"><div class="shell hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Evidence for your MTD quarter</p><h1 tabindex="-1">Link each expense to evidence</h1><p>For UK sole traders, tutors, and small club operators preparing an MTD quarterly update.</p><div class="action-row"><a class="primary" href="/?demo=1" data-route>Try it with sample data</a><span class="next-note">See a ready quarter. Changes stay in this 24-hour demo.</span><a class="secondary" href="/app" data-route>Start a private workspace</a><button class="text-action" type="button" id="open-existing">Open an existing workspace</button></div><ul class="facts"><li>Your workspace needs no account.</li><li>£15/month for more than 25 transactions.</li><li>Export a ZIP evidence pack.</li></ul></div><div class="hero-art"><picture><source media="(max-width:700px)" srcset="/assets/evidence-rail-hero-768.webp"><img src="/assets/evidence-rail-hero.webp" width="1280" height="853" alt="A paper train carries expense records towards a moon-shaped archive." fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></picture><span class="train-marker" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></div></section>
    <section class="section preview" aria-labelledby="preview-title"><div class="shell"><p class="section-kicker">A quarter at a glance</p><h2 id="preview-title">See what still needs evidence</h2><p class="section-lead">Transactions, invoices, and receipts appear in one dated view. Missing evidence stays visible until you link it.</p><div class="preview-frame"><div class="rail-panel"><h3>6 Apr – 5 Jul 2026</h3><ol class="quarter-rail"><li class="active">Capture</li><li class="active">Match</li><li>Review</li><li>Export</li></ol></div><div class="mini-records"><div class="mini-records-header"><div><strong>Quarter record</strong><br><span>6 transactions</span></div><span class="status missing">2 need evidence</span></div><div class="mini-record"><time>11 Jun</time><div><strong>Teaching card supplies</strong><small>Materials · £32.99</small></div><span class="status">Evidence linked</span></div><div class="mini-record"><time>19 May</time><div><strong>Train to client session</strong><small>Travel · £27.80</small></div><span class="status missing">Evidence missing</span></div><div class="mini-record"><time>15 Apr</time><div><strong>Spring maths tutoring</strong><small>Invoice INV-026 · £120.00</small></div><span class="status">Evidence linked</span></div></div></div></div></section>
    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="how-title"><div class="shell"><p class="section-kicker">How it works</p><h2 id="how-title">Prepare the quarter while it happens</h2><div class="steps"><article class="step"><h3>Add each transaction</h3><p>Record income or expenses. You can also import a bank CSV.</p></article><article class="step"><h3>Link the evidence</h3><p>Add a receipt, invoice, or note. Likely CSV matches are flagged before import.</p></article><article class="step"><h3>Export the evidence pack</h3><p>Download one ZIP with a transaction CSV and every linked file.</p></article></div></div></section>
    <section class="section limits" aria-labelledby="limits-title"><div class="shell limits-grid"><div><p class="section-kicker">What this tool covers</p><h2 id="limits-title">Organise evidence before you file</h2><p>Add transactions and evidence. Export a copy when you are ready to file.</p></div><div><h3>Workspace privacy, export, and deletion</h3><ul><li>Workspace keys are stored on this device.</li><li>Demo records use a separate 24-hour workspace.</li><li>You can export or delete your workspace.</li><li>No advertising trackers or third-party scripts run here.</li></ul></div></div></section>
    <section class="section price" id="price" aria-labelledby="price-title"><div class="shell price-grid"><div><p class="section-kicker">Monthly subscription</p><h2 id="price-title">Monthly subscription limits</h2><p>The free workspace accepts 25 transactions in a quarter. A £15/month subscription accepts more than 25.</p></div><div class="price-ticket"><div class="price-number">£15 <small>per month</small></div><p>The server verifies an active subscription before accepting more than 25 transactions.</p><ul><li>Receipt and invoice evidence</li><li>Bank CSV review</li><li>Accountant evidence packs</li></ul><a class="primary" href="https://api.sociobot.in/api/v1/products/mtd-evidence-rail/checkout">Open £15/month checkout</a><p class="help">Checkout opens on Dodo through Sociobot. See the <a href="/terms" data-route>terms</a>.</p><div class="license-box"><label class="field-label" for="landing-license">Have a subscription token? Paste it here.</label><div class="license-row"><input id="landing-license" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false"><button class="quiet" type="button" data-restore-license="landing-license">Restore subscription access</button></div><p id="license-message" class="help" aria-live="polite"></p></div></div></div></section>
