 and privacy":"Terms for using the record aid"}</h1>${t?'<p>MTD Evidence Rail stores your transaction records and evidence files on its hosted service. Your browser stores a 64-character workspace key.</p><h2>What we store</h2><p>We store the records, files, and dates that you add.</p><h2>Demo records</h2><p>Demo records use a separate workspace. The demo expires after 24 hours and never reads your private workspace.</p><h2>Who receives data</h2><p>We do not run advertising trackers. Choosing checkout leaves this site for Dodo through Sociobot.</p><h2>Retention and deletion</h2><p>The service keeps your private workspace in durable storage. Deleting it removes its records and files.</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>You can export your records or copy your workspace access key. Anyone with the key can change your records.</p><p>To request help with deletion, email <a href="mailto:privacy@sociobot.in">privacy@sociobot.in</a>.</p>':'<p>MTD Evidence Rail helps you organise records into an evidence pack.</p><h2>Your responsibility</h2><p>Review your records and evidence before sharing them. Keep your workspace key private.</p><h2>Monthly subscription</h2><p>The subscription costs £15 per month and allows more than 25 transactions in a quarter. It renews monthly until you cancel.</p><p>Checkout opens on Dodo through Sociobot. Subscription billing terms appear before you pay.</p><h2>Availability</h2><p>We aim to keep the service available, but we cannot promise uninterrupted access. Export your evidence pack before a deadline.</p><h2>Acceptable use</h2><p>Do not upload unlawful material or try to access another workspace. Files are limited to the supported types and sizes.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions about these terms can be sent to <a href="mailto:support@sociobot.in">support@sociobot.in</a>.</p>'}</article></main>${_()}`}function ge(){document.title="Page not found — MTD Evidence Rail",D.innerHTML=`${R()}<main id="main" class="not-found"><div class="narrow"><p class="eyebr